WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.373
Conditional Matrix Flows for Gaussian Graphical
Models, from the University of Basel,

00:00:05.453 --> 00:00:07.490
unifies sparse network inference.

00:00:07.570 --> 00:00:13.264
With one trained matrix normalizing flow it
delivers the full Bayesian posterior for every

00:00:13.344 --> 00:00:16.472
regularization strength and every l-q pseudo-norm,

00:00:16.552 --> 00:00:19.294
the marginal likelihood for model selection,

00:00:19.374 --> 00:00:23.272
and the frequentist solution path through simulated
annealing.
